OL,3,AThree arrested after raid on gang
OL,4,Aaccused of helping migrants pretend to
OL,5,Abe gay to get asylum
OL,6,
OL,7,FImmigration enforcement have made
OL,8,Farrests in connection with a suspected
OL,9,Fcriminal network believed to be behind
OL,10,Fdozens of fake asylum claims from
OL,11,Fpeople pretending to be gay.
OL,13,FThose targeted by Home Office
OL,14,Fimmigration enforcement officers on
OL,15,FTuesday morning are accused of charging
OL,16,Fmigrants up to #4,500 for fabricated
OL,17,Fevidence, including staged photographs
OL,18,Fand fake documents.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
