OL,3,AMilitary training sites to be
OL,4,Ainvestigated following rape and abuse
OL,5,Aclaims at Army college
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn independent investigation is being
OL,8,Fcarried out into 10 military training
OL,9,Fsites in England, following claims of
OL,10,Frape and sexual assault at an Army
OL,11,Fcollege for under-18s.
OL,13,FIn August, four young women told the
OL,14,FBBC they had been sexually assaulted
OL,15,Fand harassed at the Army Foundation
OL,16,FCollege, in Harrogate, North Yorkshire.
OL,18,FOne said she had been raped by several
OL,19,Ffellow junior soldiers in an attack
OL,20,Fthat lasted hours.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
