OL,3,AWhat is pneumonic plague and how does
OL,4,Ait spread?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe World Health Organization has asked
OL,7,FRussia for more information on the
OL,8,Fdeath of a worker at a Siberian plague
OL,9,Fresearch laboratory.
OL,11,FIt is still not clear exactly what led
OL,12,Fto the worker falling ill, but media
OL,13,Freports have led to a flurry of
OL,14,Fspeculation.
OL,16,FRussian officials are still
OL,17,Finvestigating the cause of the death,
OL,18,Fbut they say those who came into
OL,19,Fcontact with the researcher all tested
OL,20,Fnegative for pneumonic plague.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
